WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
The four layers explain
how adoption can grow.

00:00:02.349 --> 00:00:06.440
Individual copilots help
an engineer draft tests and code.

00:00:06.484 --> 00:00:10.240
Connected workflow assistants use
pipeline results to prepare reports.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:14.960
Bounded agents perform several approved
steps with independent checks and human

00:00:15.013 --> 00:00:19.120
approval. Shared platform
services provide context,

00:00:19.193 --> 00:00:22.720
evaluation, execution
and evidence across those layers.

00:00:22.853 --> 00:00:27.360
These are capability choices,
not four mandatory runtime steps.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.600
The platform supports the journey,

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.320
while each increase in authority
needs its own proof.
